    "readme": "  BTC & ETH Perpetual Futures OHLCV Data (Bybit)        \n This repository contains  historical OHLCV data  for  BTCUSDT  and  ETHUSDT \n Perpetual Futures (PERP)  markets, fetched directly from  Bybit . \n The dataset is suitable for: \n \n Algorithmic trading \n Strategy backtesting \n Quantitative research \n Market structure analysis \n Machine learning & time-series modeling \n \n \n  \ud83d\udcca Included Markets        \n \n  BTCUSDT Perpetual  \n  ETHUSDT Perpetual  \n \n  Exchange:  Bybit \n Market Type:  USDT-M Perpetual Futures \n \n  \u23f1 Timeframe Mapping        \n  \n \n \n File Suffix \n Timeframe \n \n \n \n \n  15  \n 15 Minutes \n \n \n  30  \n 30 Minutes \n \n \n  60  \n 1 Hour \n \n \n  240  \n 4 Hours \n \n \n  D  \n 1 Day \n \n \n  W  \n 1 Week \n \n \n  M  \n 1 Month \n \n \n  \n \n  \ud83d\udcca Data Fields        \n Each CSV file contains the following columns: \n  \n \n \n Field \n Description \n \n \n \n \n  timestamp  \n Candle open time (UTC, milliseconds) \n \n \n  open  \n Open price \n \n \n  high  \n High price \n \n \n  low  \n Low price \n \n \n  close  \n Close price \n \n \n  volume  \n Traded volume (base asset) \n \n \n  turnover  \n Traded value (USDT) \n \n \n  \n \n",
